            "review_title": "Review at La Haye Kitchen & Bar",
            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nGet Their Rib With Beer\nOct 2019 • Friends\nIt's a cozy bar in Thao Dien, which serves great food. The rib was so juicy and tender, and melted in my mouth right away. The Salmon on pasta was also fresh and its skin was crispy as it was perfectly roasted. Ginger beer with vodka the owner suggested to me was great for a person who don't drink much like me. Apparently they have a good steak too. I will come back for it.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 3, 2019",
